    79	| WIC (persons) | 12.66M | 6.68M | **52.8%** | (`would_claim_wic` gate) | $6.7B | actual avg-month ≈ 6.6M; Urban 53.5% |
    80	| EITC (tax units) | (broad `eitc_eligible` 100.7M) | 23.69M | — | 74.6% (≈ NTA by-children blend) | $66.8B | SOI claims ≈ 23.4M — claims-targeted |
