   297	| SSI | (c) + (d); (a) UNKNOWN | Stored flag is all `True`; only national payment dollars are targeted, not recipient counts. (`EVIDENCE:evidence/pinned_artifact_probe.txt:28-29`; `EVIDENCE:evidence/pinned_diagnostics_summary.txt:50-53,79,92`) |
